#. type: Title ==
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:364
#, no-wrap
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:367
#, no-wrap
msgid "The axes don't move when I try to jog them"
msgstr ""

#. type: qanda
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:369
msgid "Make sure you're out of estop, in Manual mode."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:370
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software limits don't work. I can jog past a soft limit."
msgstr ""

#. type: qanda
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:373
msgid ""
"Software limits only work when an axis has been homed, since otherwise the "
"machine doesn't know where the limits really are."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:374
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why doesn't the mouse or return key work?"
msgstr ""

#. type: qanda
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:377
msgid ""
"Sometimes the cursor needs to be in the part of the window with the text in "
"it. Move the cursor to a different region and try it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:378
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why are the modal G- and M-codes not correct in Auto mode?"
msgstr ""

#. type: qanda
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:381
msgid ""
"The modes that will be active when you enter MDI mode are shown. These are "
"read ahead of actual program execution."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:382
#, no-wrap
msgid "How can I change the fonts/colors/sizes in the Tkemc display?"
msgstr ""

#. type: qanda
#: help/tklinuxcnc.adoc:386
msgid ""
"The \"Tkemc\" file in the emc/ directory contains the X resources used by "
"the program. Almost nothing is hard coded in the program itself. You can "
"change any of these values and see the effects."
msgstr ""

