msgid "Tk"
msgstr "ტერა"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/common/glossary.adoc:357
msgid ""
"A scripting language and graphical widget toolkit with which several of "
"LinuxCNCs GUIs and selection wizards were written."
msgstr ""

