msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:118
msgid ""
"Boolean values can be on one of `TRUE`, `YES` or `1` for true/enabled and "
"one of `FALSE`, `NO` or `0` for false/disabled. The case is ignored."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:120
msgid ""
"The following sections detail each section of the configuration file, using "
"sample values for the configuration lines."
