"Testing for equality or inequality of two double-precision floating-point "
"values is inherently problematic.  The interpreter solves this problem by "
"considering values equal if their absolute difference is less than 1e-6 "
"(this value is defined as 'TOLERANCE_EQUAL' in src/emc/rs274ngc/"
"interp_internal.hh)."
