"AXIS is a graphical front-end for LinuxCNC which features a live preview and "
"backplot. It is written in Python and uses Tk and OpenGL to display its user "
"interface."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
