#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1062
msgid ""
"AXIS has a HAL output pin that indicates when an error has occurred. The "
"'axisui.error' pin will remain 'TRUE' until all error notifications have "
"been dismissed."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1066
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Type  Dir    Name\n"
"bit   OUT    axisui.error\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1070
msgid ""
"AXIS has HAL input pins to clear the pop up notifications for errors and "
"information."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1076
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Type  Dir    Name\n"
"bit   IN     axisui.notifications-clear\n"
"bit   IN     axisui.notifications-clear-error\n"
"bit   IN     axisui.notifications-clear-info\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1079
msgid ""
"AXIS has a HAL input pin that disables/enables the 'Pause/Resume' function."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1083
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Type  Dir    Name\n"
"bit   IN     axisui.resume-inhibit\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1085
#, no-wrap
msgid "AXIS Customization Hints"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1092
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"AXIS is a fairly large and difficult-to-penetrate code base, this is helpful To keep the code stable but makes it difficult to customize.\n"
"Here we will show code snippets to modify behaviours or visuals of the screen. Keep in mind the internal code of AXIS can change from time to time.\n"
"these snippets are not guaranteed to continue to work - they may need adjustment."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1093
#, no-wrap
msgid "The update function"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1097
msgid ""
"There is a function in AXIS named user_live_update that is called every time "
"AXIS updates itself. You can use this to update your own functions."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# continuous update function\n"
"def user_live_update():\n"
"    print('i am printed every update...')\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1105
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable the Close Dialog"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/axis.adoc:1111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# disable the do you want to close dialog\n"
"root_window.tk.call(\"wm\",\"protocol\",\".\",\"WM_DELETE_WINDOW\",\"destroy .\")\n"
