#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:310
msgid ""
"*box_code_info* (will hide the G-code information frame and introduce your "
"glade file here *(3b)*)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:311
msgid ""
"*box_vel_info* (will hide the velocity frames and introduce your glade file "
"*(4)*)"
