#. type: Title ===
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:644
#, no-wrap
msgid "Velocities and Overrides"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:647
msgid ""
"All sliders from GMOCCAPY can be connected to hardware encoders or hardware "
"potentiometers."
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:651
msgid ""
"For GMOCCAPY 3 some HAL pin names have changed when new controls have been "
"implemented.  Max velocity does not exist any more, it was replaced by rapid "
"override due to the demand of many users."
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:653
msgid "To connect encoders, the following pins are exported:"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:655
msgid "*gmoccapy.jog.jog-velocity.counts* _(s32 IN)_ - Jog velocity"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:656
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.jog.jog-velocity.count-enable* _(bit IN)_ - Must be True, to "
"enable counts"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:657
msgid "*gmoccapy.feed.feed-override.counts* _(s32 IN)_ - feed override"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:658
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.feed.feed-override.count-enable* _(bit IN)_ - Must be True, to "
"enable counts"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:659
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.feed.reset-feed-override* _(bit IN)_ - reset the feed override to "
"0%"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:660
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.spindle.spindle-override.counts* _(s32 IN)_ - spindle override"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:661
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.spindle.spindle-override.count-enable* _(bit IN)_ - Must be True, "
"to enable counts"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:662
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.spindle.reset-spindle-override* _(bit IN)_ - reset the spindle "
"override to 0%"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:663
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.rapid.rapid-override.counts* _(s32 IN)_ - Maximal velocity of the "
"machine"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:664
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.rapid.rapid-override.count-enable* _(bit IN)_ - Must be True, to "
"enable counts"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:666
msgid "To connect potentiometers, use the following pins:"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:668
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.jog.jog-velocity.direct-value* _(float IN)_ - To adjust the jog "
"velocity slider"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:669
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.jog.jog-velocity.analog-enable* _(bit IN)_ - Must be True, to "
"allow analog inputs"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:670
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.feed.feed-override.direct-value* _(float IN)_ - To adjust the feed "
"override slider"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:671
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.feed.feed-override.analog-enable* _(bit IN)_ - Must be True, to "
"allow analog inputs"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:672
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.spindle.spindle-override.direct-value* _(float IN)_ - To adjust "
"the spindle override slider"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:673
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.spindle.spindle-override.analog-enable* _(bit IN)_ - Must be True, "
"to allow analog inputs"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:674
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.rapid.rapid-override.direct-value* _(float)_ - To adjust the max "
"velocity slider"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:675
msgid ""
"*gmoccapy.rapid.rapid-override.analog-enable* _(bit IN)_ - Must be True, to "
"allow analog inputs"
msgstr ""

#. type: NOTE
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:680
msgid ""
"In addition, GMOCCAPY 3 offers additional HAL pins to control the new slider "
"widgets with momentary switches.  The values how fast the increase or "
"decrease will be, must be set in the glade file.  In a future release it "
