#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1232
msgid "left rotate, middle move, right zoom"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1233
msgid "left zoom, middle move, right rotate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1234
msgid "left move, middle rotate, right zoom"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1235
msgid "left zoom, middle rotate, right move"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1236
msgid "left move, middle zoom, right rotate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1237
msgid "left rotate, middle zoom, right move"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1240
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Default is left move, middle zoom, right rotate.\n"
"The mouse wheel will still zoom the preview in every mode."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1244
msgid ""
"If you select an element in the preview, the selected element will be taken "
"as rotation center point and in auto mode the corresponding code line will "
"be highlighted."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1248
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Error Messages"
msgid "Gmoccapy Messages"
msgstr "შეცდომის შეტყობინებები"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1253
msgid ""
"This will display small pop up windows displaying a message or error text, "
"similar to the ones known from AXIS.  You can delete a specific message by "
"clicking on its close button.  If you want to delete the last one, just hit "
"the `WINDOWS` key on your keyboard, or delete all messages at once with "
"`Control + Space`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1255
msgid "You are able to set some options:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1257
msgid ""
"_X Pos_ - The position of the top left corner of the message in X counted in "
"pixel from the top left corner of the screen."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1258
msgid ""
"_Y Pos_ - The position of the top left corner of the message in Y counted in "
"pixel from the top left corner of the screen."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1259
msgid "_Width_ - The width of the message box."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1261
msgid ""
"_Max. messages_ - The maximum number of messages you want to see at once.  "
"If you set this to 10, the 11^th^ message will delete the first one, so you "
"will only see the last 10."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1262
msgid "_Font_ - The font and size you want to use to display the messages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1264
msgid ""
"_Use frames_ - If you activate the checkbox, each message will be displayed "
"in a frame, so it is much easier to distinguish the messages. But you will "
"need a little bit more space."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gmoccapy.adoc:1265
msgid ""
"_Launch test message_-button - It will show a message, so you can see the "
"changes of your settings without the need to generate an error."
msgstr ""

