msgid "*`PREFERENCE`*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1544
msgid "_Loads the preference file_ into the `GcodeEditor`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1544
#, no-wrap
msgid "*`CLEAR HISTORY`*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1546
msgid "_Clears the MDI History_."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1546
#, no-wrap
msgid "*`net`*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1549
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See link:../man/man1/halcmd.1.html#COMMANDS[`halcmd net` commands].\n"
"An error will result if the command is unsuccessful."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1550
msgid "_Syntax_: `net <signal name> <pin name>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1551
msgid "__Example__: `net plasmac:jog-inhibit motion.jog-stop`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1551
#, no-wrap
msgid "*`setp`*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1555
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"_Sets the value of a pin or a parameter_.\n"
"Valid values depend on the object type of the pin or parameter.\n"
"It results in an error if the data types do not match or the pin is connected to a signal."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1556
msgid "_Syntax_: `setp <pin/parameter-name> <value>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1557
msgid "_Example_: `setp plasmac.resolution 100`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1557
#, no-wrap
msgid "*`unlinkp`*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1561
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"_Disconnects a pin from a signal_.\n"
"An error will result if the pin does not exist.\n"
"Running LinuxCNC from terminal may help determine the root cause as error messages from `hal_lib.c` will be displayed there."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1562
msgid "_Syntax_: `unlinkp <pin name>`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1563
msgid "__Example__: `unlinkp motion.jog-stop`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1565
msgid ""
"The `MDILine` function *`spindle_inhibit`* can be used by a GUI's handler "
"file to inhibit `M3`, `M4`, and `M5` spindle commands if necessary."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:1567
msgid "It is based on PyQt's _QLineEdit_."
msgstr ""

