#: src/man/man1/xhc-whb04b-6.1.adoc:138
msgid ""
"connect to `axis.`__<N>__`.jog-jog-vel-mode`.  If false the jogwheel "
"operates in position mode.  The axis will move exactly jog-scale units for "
"each count, regardless of how long that might take.  If true, the jogwheel "
"operates in velocity mode - motion stops when the wheel stops, even if that "
"means the commanded motion is not completed."
