#. type: Table
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:2649
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Allows the user to select the desired material for cutting. +\n"
"If \"VIEW MATERIAL\" is selected on the <<plasma:settings-tab,SETTINGS Tab>>, a visual reference showing key material cut settings will be displayed on the Conversational Preview Window. +\n"
"Examples are: Feed Rate, Pierce Height, Pierce Delay, Cut Height, and Kerf Width (for Conversational only). Cut Amps will be shown if PowerMax communications are enabled."
msgstr ""

