msgid "Contributing Code To QtPlasmaC"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4705
msgid ""
"Bugfixes and enhancements to QtPlasmaC are always welcome.  The preferred "
"method to contribute code is to submit a pull request (PR) comprised of a "
"single commit to the LinuxCNC GitHub repository.  For more information on "
"creating a PR, see the http://linuxcnc.org/docs/html/code/contributing-to-"
"linuxcnc.html[LinuxCNC documentation], the only pre-requisite is that you "
"https://github.com/[sign up] for a GitHub account.  All PR's are verified "
"and then committed by one of the developers.  If you are uncomfortable with "
"submitting a PR then attaching the code changes on a https://"
"forum.linuxcnc.org/plasmac[LinuxCNC Forum] thread is an acceptable method."
