#. type: Plain text
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:4708
msgid ""
"Bugfixes are accepted for both the latest released branch and master "
"branch.  If a bugfix applies to both branches, then it is only necessary to "
"submit a PR for the latest released branch as it will be merged into master "
"branch by a developer."
