#. type: Plain text
#: src/user/user-intro.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This document is focused on the use of LinuxCNC, it is intended for readers "
"who have already installed and configured it.  Some information on "
"installation is given in the following chapters.  The complete documentation "
"on installation and configuration can be found in the integrator's manual."
