#. type: TH
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "JOYHANDLE"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:32
msgid "joyhandle - sets nonlinear joypad movements, deadbands and scales"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:35
msgid "B<loadrt joyhandle> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]]"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:38
msgid ""
"The component B<joyhandle> uses the following formula for a non linear "
"joypad movements:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "y = (scale * (a * x^power + b * x)) + offset\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:50
msgid ""
"The parameters a and b are adjusted in such a way, that the function starts "
"at (deadband,offset) and ends at (1,scale+offset)\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:52
msgid ""
"Negative values will be treated point symmetrically to origin\\&. Values "
"-deadband E<lt> x E<lt> +deadband will be set to zero\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:54
msgid ""
"Values x E<gt> 1 and x E<lt> -1 will be skipped to \\(+-(scale+offset)\\&. "
"Invert transforms the function to a progressive movement\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:56
msgid ""
"With power one can adjust the nonlinearity (default = 2)\\&. Default for "
"deadband is 0\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:58
msgid ""
"Valid values are: power ≥ 1\\&.0 (reasonable values are 1\\&.x \\&.\\&. 4-5, "
"take higher power-values for higher deadbands (E<gt>0\\&.5), if you want to "
"start with a nearly horizontal slope), 0 ≤ deadband E<lt> 0\\&.99 "
"(reasonable 0\\&.1)\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:60
msgid ""
"An additional offset component can be set in special cases (default = 0)\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:62
msgid "All values can be adjusted for each instance separately\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:65
msgid "B<joyhandle>\\&.I<N> (requires a floating-point thread)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:70
msgid "B<joyhandle>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<in> float in"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:74
msgid "B<joyhandle>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out> float out"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:79
msgid "B<joyhandle>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<power> float rw (default: I<2\\&.0>)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:83
msgid "B<joyhandle>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<deadband> float rw (default: I<0\\&.>)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/joyhandle.9:87
msgid "B<joyhandle>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<scale> float rw (default: I<1\\&.>)"
msgstr ""

