msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:32
msgid "limit3 - Follow input signal while obeying limits"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:35
msgid ""
"Limit the output signal to fall between min and max, limit its slew rate to "
"less than maxv per second, and limit its second derivative to less than maxa "
"per second squared\\&. When the signal is a position, this means that the "
"position, velocity, and acceleration are limited\\&."
msgstr ""

